  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "1783c586-47a9-2141-85b3-fed3b03e14c7"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["15"], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "183bf992-b84b-874b-945e-d5f75d5ab40a"],
 ", or ",
 Cell[BoxData["19"], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c2dac379-41bf-be4c-a17d-37682b13812f"],
 ". Their arrangement must provide the representative cells required by the \
